1
00:01:04,340 --> 00:01:07,660
=Bionic Trace=

2
00:01:07,740 --> 00:01:10,620
=Episode 8=

3
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:23,230
I just found a lot of these

4
00:01:23,230 --> 00:01:24,800
in that storage room.

5
00:01:25,190 --> 00:01:26,590
They're android parts.

6
00:01:27,870 --> 00:01:29,270
There are over a dozen boxes.

7
00:01:30,120 --> 00:01:31,510
That's enough

8
00:01:31,870 --> 00:01:33,870
to build more than a dozen androids.

9
00:01:34,590 --> 00:01:36,000
What exactly are they planning?

10
00:01:36,910 --> 00:01:37,800
(Come to the computer.)

11
00:01:37,950 --> 00:01:38,800
(I found something.)

12
00:01:42,260 --> 00:01:46,060
(Android neural skeleton)

13
00:01:53,380 --> 00:01:53,674
(Control wiring harness,
transmission gear assembly)

14
00:01:53,674 --> 00:01:53,940
(forearm drive shaft,
translucent ceramic shell)

15
00:01:53,940 --> 00:01:54,420
(Main joint spherical actuator,
joint bearing, upper arm linkage)

16
00:01:54,420 --> 00:01:54,940
(Fingertip sensor, finger joint gear
mechanism, back-of-hand control module)

17
00:01:54,940 --> 00:01:55,500
(Wrist actuator, tendon drive cable)

18
00:01:58,910 --> 00:01:59,680
They...

19
00:01:59,680 --> 00:02:00,870
They're really going to

20
00:02:00,870 --> 00:02:03,160
replace Senyao with an android.

21
00:02:03,590 --> 00:02:04,360
Creating androids

22
00:02:04,360 --> 00:02:05,760
that are exact replicas of citizens

23
00:02:05,760 --> 00:02:06,910
is illegal.

24
00:02:07,270 --> 00:02:07,950
Of course,

25
00:02:07,950 --> 00:02:09,470
unless the citizen is already dead.

26
00:02:10,810 --> 00:02:11,650
Impossible.

27
00:02:12,440 --> 00:02:13,550
Senyao must still be here.

28
00:02:29,720 --> 00:02:31,360
Are you okay, Ada?

29
00:02:31,880 --> 00:02:33,550
A neural signal overload device.

30
00:02:34,520 --> 00:02:35,390
I'm fine.

31
00:02:35,800 --> 00:02:36,420
(You've)

32
00:02:37,160 --> 00:02:38,390
(come to the wrong place.)

33
00:02:43,240 --> 00:02:44,800
We're not here to cause trouble.

34
00:02:44,910 --> 00:02:46,320
We just want to find out the truth.

35
00:02:57,600 --> 00:02:58,630
Who

36
00:02:59,160 --> 00:03:00,390
are you?

37
00:03:01,190 --> 00:03:02,110
Senyao.

38
00:03:02,910 --> 00:03:03,910
It really is you.

39
00:03:05,820 --> 00:03:10,020
(Song Yang)

40
00:03:10,030 --> 00:03:10,720
Captain Deng.

41
00:03:10,720 --> 00:03:11,750
We've found something.

42
00:03:12,240 --> 00:03:13,080
We analyzed

43
00:03:13,080 --> 00:03:14,440
that idol's singing video frame by frame

44
00:03:14,440 --> 00:03:16,520
and uncovered a hidden message.

45
00:03:16,960 --> 00:03:18,390
It's a specific address

46
00:03:18,390 --> 00:03:19,800
on the outskirts of the city.

47
00:03:20,910 --> 00:03:22,000
Did you lock the door?

48
00:03:22,030 --> 00:03:23,240
Open it immediately.

49
00:03:24,440 --> 00:03:25,110
You've triggered

50
00:03:25,110 --> 00:03:26,270
some security mechanisms.

51
00:03:26,520 --> 00:03:28,080
The company knows you're here.

52
00:03:28,270 --> 00:03:29,550
You need to find a way out.

53
00:03:30,160 --> 00:03:31,030
Song Yang.

54
00:03:32,030 --> 00:03:33,830
The door has a built-in
electromagnetic lock.

55
00:03:33,830 --> 00:03:35,080
An electromagnetic pulse

56
00:03:35,270 --> 00:03:37,030
should temporarily disable it.

57
00:03:37,030 --> 00:03:38,600
A homemade EMP?

58
00:03:38,750 --> 00:03:40,080
You've come to the right person.

59
00:03:40,390 --> 00:03:41,240
Give me ten seconds.

60
00:03:47,880 --> 00:03:48,390
Lulu.

61
00:03:48,390 --> 00:03:49,190
We need to go.

62
00:03:49,440 --> 00:03:50,030
Oh.

63
00:03:58,380 --> 00:03:59,150
Senyao.

64
00:04:00,600 --> 00:04:01,750
Do you remember me?

65
00:04:03,240 --> 00:04:04,270
Of course I remember you.

66
00:04:04,880 --> 00:04:06,160
The message I sent you...

67
00:04:06,160 --> 00:04:07,000
Did you get it?

68
00:04:08,960 --> 00:04:10,030
But I regret it now.

69
00:04:10,270 --> 00:04:11,390
I shouldn't have done this.

70
00:04:12,270 --> 00:04:13,800
I've dragged innocent people into this.

71
00:04:14,440 --> 00:04:16,440
But we just saw that file.

72
00:04:16,440 --> 00:04:18,070
- They're going to use an android...
- We can't talk here.

73
00:04:19,200 --> 00:04:19,790
There's no time.

74
00:04:19,790 --> 00:04:20,550
Follow me.

75
00:04:21,390 --> 00:04:22,550
I'll get you out of here.

76
00:04:24,340 --> 00:04:29,620
(Recording studio)

77
00:04:32,880 --> 00:04:33,640
Senyao.

78
00:04:33,640 --> 00:04:35,070
Why haven't you left?

79
00:04:35,070 --> 00:04:36,920
Are they keeping you here
against your will?

80
00:04:37,350 --> 00:04:38,440
A long time ago,

81
00:04:38,440 --> 00:04:40,230
they started planning
to replace me with an android.

82
00:04:41,230 --> 00:04:43,000
The company discussed it
with me many times,

83
00:04:43,270 --> 00:04:44,350
but I always refused.

84
00:04:44,760 --> 00:04:46,480
Eventually, they lost patience

85
00:04:48,200 --> 00:04:49,640
and locked me up here.

86
00:04:49,670 --> 00:04:51,830
They claimed it was so
I could write lyrics, but...

87
00:04:59,720 --> 00:05:00,740
This leads to the back exit.

88
00:05:19,390 --> 00:05:20,320
It was specially designed

89
00:05:20,320 --> 00:05:21,670
to keep androids locked up.

90
00:05:22,350 --> 00:05:23,350
I'm sorry.

91
00:05:23,790 --> 00:05:25,880
You've seen too much
that you shouldn't have.

92
00:05:26,350 --> 00:05:27,790
The company will come after you.

93
00:05:28,040 --> 00:05:29,110
I had no choice.

94
00:05:29,600 --> 00:05:30,320
(Ada.)

95
00:05:30,350 --> 00:05:32,510
He's cut off all the circuits outside.

96
00:05:32,880 --> 00:05:35,070
He's probably trying
to stop me from doing that again.

97
00:05:36,830 --> 00:05:37,950
Let me figure something out.

98
00:05:39,110 --> 00:05:39,880
Ada.

99
00:05:40,040 --> 00:05:41,350
(I won't let them catch you.)

100
00:05:43,070 --> 00:05:44,880
I knew there was
something wrong with him.

101
00:06:10,200 --> 00:06:11,270
Senyao?

102
00:06:11,550 --> 00:06:12,670
Qiu Lulu?

103
00:06:15,720 --> 00:06:18,000
I knew that wasn't
the real you just now.

104
00:06:26,920 --> 00:06:27,570
Lulu.

105
00:06:27,920 --> 00:06:29,960
After the video controversy
went viral last time,

106
00:06:30,600 --> 00:06:31,790
the company saw it

107
00:06:31,790 --> 00:06:33,200
as an opportunity for more publicity.

108
00:06:35,230 --> 00:06:36,000
I had no one left

109
00:06:36,000 --> 00:06:37,070
I could trust.

110
00:06:38,510 --> 00:06:39,550
That's why I thought of you.

111
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:40,920
I'm sorry, Lulu.

112
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:42,950
I used you.

113
00:06:43,390 --> 00:06:44,110
No.

114
00:06:44,320 --> 00:06:46,070
I came to rescue you willingly.

115
00:06:50,040 --> 00:06:50,880
MG

116
00:06:52,760 --> 00:06:54,600
wants a perfect idol who obeys orders.

117
00:06:55,880 --> 00:06:57,230
That night backstage,

118
00:06:57,270 --> 00:06:59,790
I once again rejected their plan
to use a stand-in.

119
00:07:00,920 --> 00:07:02,390
After that, they locked me up here.

120
00:07:03,110 --> 00:07:04,600
They even made my replica

121
00:07:04,760 --> 00:07:05,720
guard me.

122
00:07:06,600 --> 00:07:07,600
How ironic.

123
00:07:09,270 --> 00:07:10,040
But

124
00:07:11,390 --> 00:07:12,290
thank you,

125
00:07:12,760 --> 00:07:13,230
Lulu.

126
00:07:13,920 --> 00:07:15,070
Sorry to interrupt you two,

127
00:07:15,920 --> 00:07:17,440
but we need to leave right now.

128
00:07:21,600 --> 00:07:22,390
Don't look at me.

129
00:07:23,480 --> 00:07:24,720
I'm trapped here, too.

130
00:07:25,390 --> 00:07:26,640
If there were a way out,

131
00:07:27,480 --> 00:07:28,670
I would've escaped already.

132
00:07:45,600 --> 00:07:46,480
Mr. Li.

133
00:07:50,390 --> 00:07:51,270
Sorry to bother you.

134
00:07:52,110 --> 00:07:53,000
Recently,

135
00:07:53,000 --> 00:07:54,200
a murderer on the run

136
00:07:54,200 --> 00:07:55,270
has been spotted around our city.

137
00:07:55,270 --> 00:07:56,110
So

138
00:07:56,230 --> 00:07:57,920
we're conducting routine checks.

139
00:07:58,600 --> 00:07:59,760
Have you

140
00:07:59,760 --> 00:08:01,880
noticed anything unusual?

141
00:08:02,830 --> 00:08:03,950
Lately,

142
00:08:04,200 --> 00:08:05,510
I've been in the recording studio

143
00:08:05,510 --> 00:08:06,950
working on my new album.

144
00:08:07,320 --> 00:08:09,390
I haven't noticed anyone suspicious.

145
00:08:13,270 --> 00:08:14,160
Sorry, officer.

146
00:08:14,390 --> 00:08:15,640
I still have lyrics to write.

147
00:08:15,760 --> 00:08:17,390
If there's nothing else,

148
00:08:17,550 --> 00:08:18,760
I'll get back to work.

149
00:08:20,200 --> 00:08:20,830
Captain Deng.

150
00:08:20,830 --> 00:08:22,480
This property belongs to MG Group.

151
00:08:22,600 --> 00:08:24,230
Since they haven't reported a crime,

152
00:08:24,230 --> 00:08:25,720
we have no authority
to search the premises.

153
00:08:36,550 --> 00:08:37,710
Put down your weapon!

154
00:08:41,880 --> 00:08:42,640
Officer.

155
00:08:43,880 --> 00:08:45,080
The one I just knocked down

156
00:08:45,620 --> 00:08:46,910
was my android double.

157
00:08:58,350 --> 00:08:59,910
You're the real Li Senyao.

158
00:09:01,200 --> 00:09:02,880
Creating androids identical to citizens

159
00:09:02,880 --> 00:09:03,910
is illegal.

160
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:04,840
Yes.

161
00:09:05,590 --> 00:09:06,880
Please take me into custody.

162
00:09:07,520 --> 00:09:08,790
And please go inside

163
00:09:09,110 --> 00:09:10,790
and preserve all the evidence.

164
00:09:11,200 --> 00:09:12,590
I'll tell you about

165
00:09:12,590 --> 00:09:14,440
all the illegal activities MG Company
has engaged in over the years.

166
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:16,400
They should face the consequences.

167
00:09:18,910 --> 00:09:19,670
Oh, right.

168
00:09:21,200 --> 00:09:22,150
Please also

169
00:09:22,520 --> 00:09:23,640
take her home.

170
00:09:24,000 --> 00:09:25,200
It's thanks to her

171
00:09:25,590 --> 00:09:27,000
that the truth finally came out.

172
00:09:28,230 --> 00:09:29,590
Have you seen Song Yang?

173
00:09:30,550 --> 00:09:31,760
That murderer?

174
00:09:32,030 --> 00:09:33,030
I don't know him.

175
00:09:33,400 --> 00:09:35,080
Lulu came here alone today.

176
00:09:39,000 --> 00:09:40,080
You're safe now.

177
00:09:41,230 --> 00:09:42,520
But you need to come
to the station with me

178
00:09:42,520 --> 00:09:43,280
to give a statement.

179
00:10:03,440 --> 00:10:04,280
(I've already deleted all)

180
00:10:04,280 --> 00:10:06,030
(the surveillance footage showing you.)

181
00:10:06,880 --> 00:10:08,000
(They won't be able to trace you.)

182
00:10:08,110 --> 00:10:09,150
Qiu Lulu really is a girl

183
00:10:09,150 --> 00:10:10,790
with remarkably good instincts.

184
00:10:16,760 --> 00:10:17,460
Ada.

185
00:10:18,080 --> 00:10:19,400
You've helped me so many times.

186
00:10:20,590 --> 00:10:21,550
This time,

187
00:10:22,910 --> 00:10:24,230
let me handle it.

188
00:10:30,850 --> 00:10:31,740
Actually,

189
00:10:33,350 --> 00:10:34,410
you're an android, aren't you?

190
00:10:43,280 --> 00:10:44,200
Don't worry.

191
00:10:45,000 --> 00:10:46,590
Whatever your reasons,

192
00:10:47,350 --> 00:10:48,590
you still

193
00:10:48,840 --> 00:10:50,320
helped Senyao and me.

194
00:10:52,200 --> 00:10:53,400
We won't betray you.

195
00:11:02,470 --> 00:11:03,140
(Song Yang.)

196
00:11:04,420 --> 00:11:05,280
(I don't believe Lulu)

197
00:11:05,280 --> 00:11:06,570
(failed to notice that.)

198
00:11:07,670 --> 00:11:09,670
The second Li Senyao...

199
00:11:10,460 --> 00:11:11,580
Actually an android, too.

200
00:11:12,660 --> 00:11:13,150
Yes.

201
00:11:13,230 --> 00:11:14,970
All the equipment was designed

202
00:11:14,980 --> 00:11:16,000
to confine androids.

203
00:11:16,200 --> 00:11:18,200
If that Li Senyao were really human,

204
00:11:18,280 --> 00:11:19,670
he couldn't have been unable to escape.

205
00:11:20,100 --> 00:11:21,470
So the real Li Senyao

206
00:11:21,470 --> 00:11:22,840
might still be held captive,

207
00:11:22,910 --> 00:11:25,000
or he could be enjoying
a vacation somewhere.

208
00:11:25,350 --> 00:11:26,320
He might even

209
00:11:29,760 --> 00:11:31,350
be dead.

210
00:11:31,590 --> 00:11:32,600
It's difficult for us to investigate

211
00:11:32,600 --> 00:11:33,670
what really happened.

212
00:11:34,030 --> 00:11:36,110
But I didn't tell Qiu Lulu about that.

213
00:11:36,710 --> 00:11:37,590
Song Yang.

214
00:11:37,590 --> 00:11:39,200
I don't know if I did the right thing.

215
00:11:39,390 --> 00:11:40,880
For Qiu Lulu,

216
00:11:40,980 --> 00:11:42,110
as long as the person in front of her

217
00:11:42,110 --> 00:11:43,790
brings her happiness and courage,

218
00:11:44,400 --> 00:11:46,640
who he really is may no longer matter.

219
00:11:46,690 --> 00:11:48,340
I agree with you, Song Yang.

220
00:11:48,880 --> 00:11:49,910
(Speaking of which,)

221
00:11:49,910 --> 00:11:51,550
(this wasn't a wasted trip.)

222
00:11:51,670 --> 00:11:52,560
The android parts and limbs

223
00:11:52,570 --> 00:11:53,910
we found in the recording studio

224
00:11:53,910 --> 00:11:54,670
are very interesting.

225
00:11:55,090 --> 00:11:56,710
They're all Cedar technology

226
00:11:56,960 --> 00:11:58,590
and should be strictly controlled.

227
00:11:59,400 --> 00:12:00,590
(I checked the logs in their system)

228
00:12:00,590 --> 00:12:02,350
(that they hadn't managed to delete.)

229
00:12:02,710 --> 00:12:04,550
I found that all these materials

230
00:12:04,550 --> 00:12:05,640
came from

231
00:12:05,640 --> 00:12:07,320
an underground black market
hidden downtown.

232
00:12:07,550 --> 00:12:08,790
A lot of

233
00:12:08,790 --> 00:12:10,400
Cedar Group's technology
is being traded there.

234
00:12:11,840 --> 00:12:13,550
Perhaps our next step

235
00:12:13,710 --> 00:12:15,590
should be to investigate this market.

236
00:12:25,590 --> 00:12:26,440
We'll...

237
00:12:27,200 --> 00:12:28,590
We'll definitely uncover the truth.

238
00:12:42,370 --> 00:12:49,650
♪I'm the one who's broken♪

239
00:12:50,480 --> 00:12:55,350
♪Calm, ordinary, and reckless♪

240
00:12:55,390 --> 00:12:58,260
♪That's me, too♪

241
00:12:59,800 --> 00:13:03,320
♪Carefully sketching
and shaping every detail♪

242
00:13:04,150 --> 00:13:07,620
♪Laughter and tears make life feel real♪

243
00:13:08,240 --> 00:13:12,030
♪Don't fear that it's not worth it.
Just be brave♪

244
00:13:12,350 --> 00:13:14,880
♪And learn from your mistakes♪

245
00:13:16,820 --> 00:13:19,480
♪If the human heart
is impossible to fathom♪

246
00:13:19,480 --> 00:13:21,610
♪Could selling my soul and body♪

247
00:13:21,610 --> 00:13:24,780
♪Bring me something more?♪

248
00:13:25,480 --> 00:13:32,210
♪Stroke by stroke,
I draw the perfect outline♪

249
00:13:33,040 --> 00:13:36,440
♪Sadness is blue♪

250
00:13:37,420 --> 00:13:40,660
♪How would you paint me?♪

251
00:13:41,660 --> 00:13:45,390
♪Layering, crossing, blending endlessly♪

252
00:13:45,490 --> 00:13:47,650
♪Painting without restraint♪

253
00:13:47,840 --> 00:13:50,430
♪Covering the person I used to be♪

254
00:13:50,430 --> 00:13:54,620
♪If I could start over♪

255
00:13:54,790 --> 00:13:58,690
♪I'd show more feeling
in every look and gesture♪

256
00:13:58,800 --> 00:14:01,440
♪Give me back my smile♪

257
00:14:02,040 --> 00:14:04,520
♪Find joy even in hardship♪

258
00:14:05,020 --> 00:14:10,260
♪Don't let the next version of me
be left with nothing♪
